----------------------------------------------------------------------
Speaker diarization -- segmentation
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Model:    DiariZen-Large-s80-v2 (BUT-FIT/diarizen-wavlm-large-s80-md-v2)
Authors:  Brno University of Technology, Speech@FIT
Source:   https://huggingface.co/BUT-FIT/diarizen-wavlm-large-s80-md-v2
License:  CC-BY-NC-4.0 (NON-COMMERCIAL ONLY)

  The DiariZen segmentation weights are released under CC-BY-NC-4.0
  because the training mixture includes datasets (RAMC, MSDWild,
  DIHARD-3) that prohibit commercial use. By downloading and using
  these weights you agree to:

    - Use them for research, academic, personal, or other
      non-commercial purposes only.
    - Not redistribute or use the weights -- directly or as a derivative
      -- in any commercial product or service.

  speaches-plus does not bundle these weights. They are downloaded
  by `rust/scripts/fetch-models.sh` from the upstream Hugging Face
  repository and converted to ONNX by `rust/scripts/export-diarizen-onnx.py`.
  Operators who require commercial use must:

    a) Replace the segmentation model with one carrying a permissive
       license (e.g. pyannote-segmentation-3.0 under MIT), or
    b) Train an equivalent on commercially-licensed data.

  See `rust/src/realtime/diarization/` for the integration surface;
  the wrapper accepts any ONNX with the same `(B, 1, samples) -> (B, T, C)`
  powerset shape.

